   154	## Persistent data layer (recorded 2026-10-06)
   155	
   156	- Analytical datasets are Parquet on the NAS at `/mnt/nas/Data/beijing-lot` (CIFS automount; env `BEIDAN_PARQUET_ROOT`); short-lived data stays on NVMe. Read through the package, never by opening files directly: `beidan::read_dataset()` (Arrow, typed, per-file sha256 verified) and `beidan::dataset_query()` (DuckDB, read-only). `dataset_query()` registers **one table per call**, so cross-table joins go in R.
